## `ui/fonts/`

IBM Plex Sans and IBM Plex Mono, the typefaces the documentation site and the
rooms interface are set in. The five `.woff2` files are the Latin subsets
published by the Fontsource project from IBM's releases, taken from
`@fontsource-variable/ibm-plex-sans@5` and `@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono@5` and
vendored on 27 July 2026. Both surfaces reach these files through symlinks, so
this directory is the only copy.

They are vendored rather than loaded from a font CDN, and that is not a
temporary arrangement to be undone later. Browsers partitioned the HTTP cache,
which ended the cross-site font caching a CDN used to buy, so a CDN now costs
two extra connections and gains nothing; and it would disclose every reader's
address to a third party, which is a poor arrangement for a project about not
handing out authority. Track upstream by bumping the Fontsource versions above;
there is no condition under which these files go away.

Copyright (c) 2017 IBM Corp. with Reserved Font Name "Plex".

This Font Software is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1.
The licence travels with the files as `ui/fonts/OFL.txt`, in full: the licence
requires each copy of the Font Software to carry it, and a summary would not
satisfy that.

